## Priority Scale (Numbers Only)

| Priority | Use For | Quick Create |
|----------|---------|--------------|
| 0 | HALT, critical failures | `bd-halt "reason"` |
| 1 | Work claims, urgent blockers | `bd-blocker "title"` |
| 2 | Decisions, action items | `bd-decision "title"` |
| 3-4 | Low/backlog | manual `bd create` |

