## Troubleshooting

**"I don't know what pattern to use"**
→ Check `project-context.md` first
→ Look for similar existing code

**"Branch sync failed"**
→ Run `git worktree list` to check conflicts
→ See `docs/beads-git-workflow.md` for recovery

**"bd-land failed"**
→ Check if branches have diverged
→ Manual sync: merge `beads-sync` → `main` → your branch

**"Can't checkout to main"**
→ Another worktree has `main` checked out
→ Run: `git -C .git/beads-worktrees/beads-sync checkout beads-sync`

**"Auto-sync not working?"**
→ Check background sync log: `tail ~/.bmad/sync.log`
→ Verify daemon running: `bd stats`
→ Check config mode: `bd-config-sync`

